    {
      "id": "note_input",
      "attached_node": "input",
      "text": "KNOWN 3D MOTION\nThe entire volume is rotated about all three physical axes (3, -4 and 6 degrees in the authored ZYX rotation order), then displaced by (Z=0.8, Y=-0.7, X=1.2) micrometres. Voxel spacing is (1.1, 0.4, 0.3) micrometres. Translation alone cannot undo this motion.",
